{"availability":"available","full":"khang3004/Edu_Omni_MyMind","name":"Edu_Omni_MyMind","description":"EduMIND — Multimodal Bilingual Lecture Assistant with Anti-Forget RAG, Whisper ASR, VietMix NMT (CMI-aware), and Human-in-the-Loop Active Learning via Label Studio. Built for code-mixed Vietnamese–English academic environments.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":10,"forks":6,"created":"2026-05-20T08:43:20Z","updated":"2026-06-23T09:18:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://khang3004.github.io/Edu_Omni_MyMind/","topics":["active-learning","bilingual","code-switching","docker","education-technology","human-in-the-loop","label-studio","langchain","machine-translation","multimodal","nlp","python","qdrant","rag","speech-recognition","streamlit","vector-database","vietnamese-nlp","whisper"],"demo":"https://khang3004.github.io/Edu_Omni_MyMind/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:55.117Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:55.117Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:55.117Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.451Z","stars":10,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:11.447Z","stars":10,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:28:55.733Z","stars":10,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:57:55.117Z","stars":10,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["EduMIND is an enterprise-grade, highly modular Bilingual Lecture Assistant & Active Learning Pipeline. Designed specifically for academic environments where lectures mix languages (e.g., Code-Mixed Vietnamese-English, such as \"hôm nay chúng ta học attention mechanism\"), EduMIND transcribes bilingual speech, measures code-switching metrics, translates text preserving technical terms, indexes slides, and executes retrieval-augmented generation (RAG).","The system integrates a Human-in-the-Loop Active Learning framework powered by Label Studio and an ML backend to continually harvest human-corrected data, immediately updating the